## Security

- **Never** hardcode secrets — they live in the environment{% if application %} or a gitignored `.env`, wrapped in `SecretStr`{% endif %}, and `.env` is never committed
- Never auto-run destructive commands (`rm -rf`, `del /s`, `curl | sh`)
- Respect `.ignore` paths (every `.env` file except `.env.example`, `secrets/`, `.ssh/`)
